{"batch":1331,"files":[{"name":"b23b793b138a.mp3","text":"彼は迫害者を懲らしめて人民たちのあだを討つだろう。","sha256":"99b87747592b71b1415388cd117d6bcc557214fecb9e226bbcfc8644d2d81c62","size":21405},{"name":"b62b0c4a6e2f.mp3","text":"彼は釣り竿でどう釣りをすればいいか知っている。","sha256":"4da9ecf071be8f9eab38e4c0ddd3746113158ba880b81dbfaaafff31cc34207d","size":17805},{"name":"b7c901137d37.mp3","text":"彼は私を脅迫した。","sha256":"c162d7d43744104d10e2faa59c8b4fcbabe593baecc61441ce311f01a754bf3c","size":11325},{"name":"b99183d26655.mp3","text":"彼は農夫に身をやつして城下町に潜入した。","sha256":"3c5a8b4a1100689ed96dd7ce371aea90ebdec74f91770f3a09f98a16fdf0dc09","size":19101},{"name":"bf449a9a7d0e.mp3","text":"彼は約束した。しかるに、現れなかった。","sha256":"be6dcce6ff24ebe96c6d810bfba93479aab9d30ceaf72a49cf4ff5a94d09779a","size":21261},{"name":"c545528e325b.mp3","text":"彼は警察に自首したそうです。","sha256":"df1e19cc959036612dfeb9e74ea13a2f8da7a188875da5bb63de8f8939a61f4c","size":13053},{"name":"cb9703066952.mp3","text":"彼は遅刻の口実をこしらえた。","sha256":"57e2244f41c21cdba328e2b38869d437c4b53c8d31f48d52298a49cfa1586de9","size":13629},{"name":"cff66556add3.mp3","text":"彼は酸素不足で死んだ。","sha256":"b22437137e648e3d949d8c45e7d5b802fdd979d513c3c410818e3872d884de7f","size":11037},{"name":"def3604bbb0d.mp3","text":"彼は立候補した。","sha256":"1a98063d2450545c3420269c49a497b44db63be7f43d2c48242b10b11ab6cd1d","size":8877},{"name":"e51bffd5cbfb.mp3","text":"彼は箸が使えるよ。","sha256":"610f88c989f16f4b1175f61293ae8eb92a380ef02998c77a0f136a881a402362","size":9597}]}
